<details open>
{{apisummary.header|Changes being Hotfixed to 12.0.5 before it goes live}}
* Instant-cast spells that are secret will no longer cause the {{api|t=e|UNIT_SPELLCAST_SUCCEEDED}} event to get sent for any units other than the player.
* The {{api|t=w|ModelSceneActorBase:SetModelByUnit|ModelSceneActor:SetModelByUnit}} and {{api|t=w|PlayerModel:SetUnit|Model:SetUnit}} APIs will no longer accept unit tokens for units which have secret identity.
** These will not error - instead, they'll return a nil value in-place of the existing <code>success</code> return.
* Various chat channel APIs are no longer usable while chat lockdown is in effect, or from within macros.
